          <span>Mobile: 40px</span>
          <span>Tag/class name: h2, .h2</span>
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2><span>Desktop:</span> Boogy Brut Poster</h2>
          <h2 class="mobile"><span>Mobile:</span> Boogy Brut Poster</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="style-guide__typography-item">
        <p class="text-body">
          <span>H3</span>
